      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ARKUNA (6) has been racing at Menangle since switching from Queensland, kicking off for the Troy Williams yard with a fighting win over a mile before finishing less than 5m off the winner last week. Both of those results were from similar draws to this and she look nicely placed. MAGIC MATTEO (10) draws on the back row but looks close to a win after back-to-back placings here, missing by a neck as runner-up two back then racing parked but boxing on in last week's third. With luck from the back row he is good enough to win a race of this calibre. ZACHARY SHANNON (8) cops a wide barrier but is going well, clocking in second in three of his last four outings here. BELLAGANOOSH (2) progressed nicely last start when she scored at Eugowra at her second run of the campaign. May be fitter again and should have no excuses from this advantageous draw.",
